{"openapi": "3.1.0", "info": {"title": "wiener-api", "version": "0.1.0"}, "paths": {"/api/artifacts": {"post": {"summary": "Upload a gated pipeline directory", "operationId": "uploadArtifact", "requestBody": {"content": {"multipart/form-data": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/Body_uploadArtifact"}}}, "required": true}, "responses": {"201": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/ArtifactStored"}}}}, "422": {"description": "Validation Error", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}}, "/api/runs": {"get": {"summary": "The board", "operationId": "listRuns", "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"items": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/RunRow"}, "type": "array", "title": "Response Listruns"}}}}}}, "post": {"summary": "Run a pipeline", "operationId": "submitRun", "requestBody": {"content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/SubmitRequest"}}}, "required": true}, "responses": {"202": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/RunAccepted"}}}}, "422": {"description": "Validation Error", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}}, "/api/runs/{run_id}": {"get": {"summary": "A run, projected", "operationId": "readRun", "parameters": [{"name": "run_id", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": {"type": "string", "title": "Run Id"}}], "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": true, "title": "Response Readrun"}}}}, "422": {"description": "Validation Error", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}}, "/api/runs/{run_id}/events": {"get": {"summary": "The record, in order", "description": "What the console reads before it subscribes \u2014 \u00a77.2's page-then-tail handoff.", "operationId": "readRunEvents", "parameters": [{"name": "run_id", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": {"type": "string", "title": "Run Id"}}, {"name": "after", "in": "query", "required": false, "schema": {"type": "integer", "default": -1, "title": "After"}}, {"name": "limit", "in": "query", "required": false, "schema": {"type": "integer", "default": 200, "title": "Limit"}}], "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/EventPage"}}}}, "422": {"description": "Validation Error", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}}, "/api/health": {"get": {"summary": "Is Wiener up", "operationId": "health", "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"additionalProperties": {"type": "string"}, "type": "object", "title": "Response Health"}}}}}}}}, "components": {"schemas": {"ArtifactStored": {"properties": {"artifact_id": {"type": "string", "title": "Artifact Id"}, "digest": {"type": "string", "title": "Digest"}, "size_bytes": {"type": "integer", "title": "Size Bytes"}}, "type": "object", "required": ["artifact_id", "digest", "size_bytes"], "title": "ArtifactStored"}, "Body_uploadArtifact": {"properties": {"bundle": {"type": "string", "contentMediaType": "application/octet-stream", "title": "Bundle"}}, "type": "object", "required": ["bundle"], "title": "Body_uploadArtifact"}, "EventPage": {"properties": {"events": {"items": {"additionalProperties": true, "type": "object"}, "type": "array", "title": "Events"}, "cursor": {"type": "integer", "title": "Cursor"}, "stream_id": {"type": "string", "title": "Stream Id"}}, "type": "object", "required": ["events", "cursor", "stream_id"], "title": "EventPage", "description": "A page of the record, **and where to subscribe from when you have read it**.\n\nThe handoff is the only ordering subtlety in the console (\u00a77.2), so it is a field rather\nthan a convention: page from Postgres, then tail from `stream_id`. A browser that has been\nclosed for a day does not scroll back through Redis."}, "HTTPValidationError": {"properties": {"detail": {"items": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/ValidationError"}, "type": "array", "title": "Detail"}}, "type": "object", "title": "HTTPValidationError"}, "RunAccepted": {"properties": {"run_id": {"type": "string", "title": "Run Id"}}, "type": "object", "required": ["run_id"], "title": "RunAccepted"}, "RunRow": {"properties": {"id": {"type": "string", "title": "Id"}, "phase": {"type": "string", "title": "Phase"}, "executor": {"type": "string", "title": "Executor"}, "submitted_by": {"type": "string", "title": "Submitted By"}, "submitted_at": {"type": "string", "format": "date-time", "title": "Submitted At"}}, "type": "object", "required": ["id", "phase", "executor", "submitted_by", "submitted_at"], "title": "RunRow"}, "SubmitRequest": {"properties": {"artifact_id": {"type": "string", "title": "Artifact Id"}, "params": {"additionalProperties": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"items": {"type": "string"}, "type": "array"}]}, "type": "object", "title": "Params", "default": {}}, "executor": {"type": "string", "const": "local", "title": "Executor", "default": "local"}}, "additionalProperties": false, "type": "object", "required": ["artifact_id"], "title": "SubmitRequest"}, "ValidationError": {"properties": {"loc": {"items": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "integer"}]}, "type": "array", "title": "Location"}, "msg": {"type": "string", "title": "Message"}, "type": {"type": "string", "title": "Error Type"}, "input": {"title": "Input"}, "ctx": {"type": "object", "title": "Context"}}, "type": "object", "required": ["loc", "msg", "type"], "title": "ValidationError"}}}}
